# Git safety

- Use branch pattern `task/*` from `vibeops task add`.
- Include TASK id in commits: `feat(task-nnn): …`.
- No force-push to shared branches.
- Run `vibeops task ship`, `task merge`, `task sync` when the human asks — do not merge locally in the IDE unless requested.
